{"id": "DepZ5swSnmx", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Why did Mahadev become half man, half woman? Because without her, creation could not go on 🔱\n\nFrom the Shiva Purana (Shatarudra Samhita, chapter 3): the beings Brahma made would not multiply, and a voice from the sky told him to create through pairs. But no woman had been created yet, so Brahma did hard tapas for Shiva's power. Pleased, Shiva appeared as Ardhanarishvara, half male and half female, and then separated Devi Shivaa from his own body.\n\nWhat did Brahma ask of her, and how did the wheel of time turn once more? Part 2 tomorrow ✨\n\nNavdurga, Day 9, Part 1 of 2. Told as Tholu Bommalata, Andhra's leather shadow puppets 🪔\n\nSource: Shiva Purana, Shatarudra Samhita, chapter 3\n\nSend this to someone who watched all nine with you 🤍\n\nHappy Navami 🙏\n\n#maasiddhidatri #ardhanarishvara #navami #shivapurana #navdurga", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792350981, "like_count": 4336, "comment_count": 32, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2187696468482603a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 55.622, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMdJMgPBFMalkBISYTjlwYstH_MrUga-KJmSn9Lee8gEMYxW-rp7Sy0jVAn8q0qIU3CI4EukjARYQ6IeDtOWAolNVyFUQ6zgIE0uTM.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=AdqdsH-nu3oYaidUznAINAfrfYPaItWi6IQGKRc6cuf7KZkNCukT2Nw91vNM0HgwKHuu2EzP4jXzL6a-5yFT99bc&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=EMJz1kW7vF4Q7kNvwH3hvXr&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=CjLYt4gbw2NZkFcZQMih-g&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQTXN-nDoeOXUSuJPHue8JBtWUrdN_KkeHLOpbMFOI56iA&oe=6AF445CD", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 55.622, "resoluti